WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.895
Sally: I'm hungry.

2
00:00:03.896 --> 00:00:07.947
Mom: Dinner is

3
00:00:07.948 --> 00:00:10.361
ready. Sit down, everyone.

4
00:00:10.362 --> 00:00:14.995
Dad: Mmm, I like salad.

5
00:00:14.996 --> 00:00:17.027
I'm full!

6
00:00:17.028 --> 00:00:22.000
Sally: I'm not full!

7
00:00:22.001 --> 00:00:24.473
Mom: I am sleepy!

8
00:00:24.474 --> 00:00:26.533
Sally: I'm not

9
00:00:26.534 --> 00:00:31.322
sleepy. I'm thirsty!

